Z||000007||rogergarrison||06-29-2001||01:10 PM||||You think dial up is bad.....try webtv  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>I dont have dsl in the area yet, and Roadrunner has to have a component installed in cmpt, and I have laptop. I say (even though im told not) that its just because of all the computers online now.||||reg||1
